abstract: >-
  D10Z-TTA is a unified computational framework for reconciling 
  contradictory physical theories as valid projections from Point Zero 
  Omnidimensional at scale GM10⁻⁵¹. The framework includes validation 
  against SPARC galaxy rotation curves and Hubble tension data.
